thcal P:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathcal P:V\\to V\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3DerivativeOperator}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3DerivativeOperator}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive3\\text{-}derivative\\text{-}operator} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3DerivativeOperator}_S(X,D)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(D,\\mathcal P(X),\\mathcal P(X))\n\\land\\forall A\\subseteq X\\;(D(A)\\subseteq A)\n\\land\\forall A,B\\subseteq X\\;(A\\subseteq B\\to D(A)\\subseteq D(B))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive3\\text{-}derivative\\text{-}operator} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive3DerivativeOperator}_S(X,D)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(D,\\mathcal P(X),\\mathcal P(X))\n\\land\\forall A\\subseteq X\\;(D(A)\\subseteq A)\n\\land\\forall A,B\\subseteq X\\;(A\\subseteq B\\to D(A)\\subseteq D(B))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>描述集合论导数是幂集上的单调收缩算子；微积分导数与线性算子定义均不是兼容来源。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on